From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gemstone <gemstone@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:43:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] drm/tidss, drm/imagination: take the drivers from
 v6.18.64

Debian trixie's 6.12 knows neither the AM62P/J722S display unit (tidss)
nor the PowerVR BXS-4-64 GPU (imagination). Take both drivers, and the
PowerVR uapi header, unchanged from kernel.org v6.18.64. The next patch
adapts them to the 6.12 DRM core.
